        "item_bwtFnh": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What does WELLFIT stand for?",
            "content": "<p>WELLFIT was born from a personal journey toward better health—and we’ve grown to support over <strong>30,000+ people</strong> in making fitness not just a routine, but a <strong>lifestyle</strong>. We believe that staying active shouldn’t be a struggle—it should be an empowering, sustainable habit.</p><p>Our vision is to help more people live <strong>healthier, freer lives</strong>, and face each day with energy and optimism.</p>"
